{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42930","headline":"鹊 · 韩溉","name":"鹊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才见离巢羽翼开，尽能轻扬出尘埃。\n人间树好纷纷占，天上桥成草草回。\n几度送风临玉户，一时传喜到妆台。\n若教颜色如霜雪，应与清平作瑞来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩溉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}